{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21094","headline":"芳树 · 元稹","name":"芳树","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芳树已寥落，孤英尤可嘉。\n可怜团团叶，盖覆深深花。\n游蜂竞钻刺，鬬雀亦纷拏。\n天生细碎物，不爱好华光。\n非无歼殄法，念尔有生涯。\n春雷一声发，惊燕亦惊蛇。\n清池养神蔡，已复长虾蟇。\n雨露贵平施，吾其春草芽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21094.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21094","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}